All-in-One completed its Release build with zero warnings and zero errors.

Its verified local publication contained:

- 108 distribution files.
- 23 parser modules.
- 121 configuration keys.
- Verified Release-output hashes.
- Successful standalone startup testing.

The independent Forever distribution retains its additional parser module and separate source architecture.

These results establish build and automated-test status. They do not prove full packet compatibility across all registered client builds.

---

## Retail SQL Compatibility Verification

A verified Retail 12.1.5.70783 PKT was processed using both the original TrinityCore WPP and Elysium Retail WPP.

The resulting SQL files contained:

- 428 executable statements.
- 41 database tables.
- 8,018 value rows.
- Identical packet-derived SQL content.

Only the generated parsing-date comment differed.

Removing that metadata line made the SQL files byte-identical.

The accompanying parsed-text outputs also matched after excluding their parsing-date metadata.

This verifies equivalent output for the tested capture and configuration.

Additional historical SQL investigations found no confirmed generator defect requiring modification. Outputs showing evidence of manual editing were not used to justify parser changes.

